      "content": "hey so im type 2 diabetic and i started taking this new berry extract supplement yesterday for energy... but since then i feel like im constantly parched and i literally cant stop going to the bathroom. i feel kinda wiped out too. do u think the supplement is just making me dehydrated or is something else up?",
